mapping "V5864.1" source="V5864" target="242116005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5864 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V58.6 (passenger of pick-up/van injured in
        noncollision transport accident, traffic) refined with activity=vital activities
        (rest/sleep/meals/hygiene). Parent V58.6 Athena Maps-to 432509 (Accident to motor vehicle on
        road, not involving collision, SNOMED CT 242116005). Target fully subsumes the
        vehicle/occupant/noncollision axis; the Swedish activity suffix has no SNOMED CT representation and
        is lost. broader (one axis lost), high (verified crosswalk on the parent, one-level breadth).
        """
}
